{"id":8867094200519,"title":"Dragonfly Patchwork Pattern Quilt Set, Animal Style, Dragonfly Quilt","handle":"dragonfly-patchwork-pattern-quilt-set-animal-style-dragonfly-quilt","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace rustic charm and comfort with this beautiful Dragonfly Patchwork Quilt Set from Jeminise. Featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics, this quilt set brings a cozy, timeless look to any bedroom, making it a perfect addition for warmth and tradition. Personalize it with your name or add extra pillowcases for a unique touch.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRustic Farmhouse Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Adorn your bedroom with the countryside charm of a dragonfly patchwork pattern, offering a cozy and traditional aesthetic.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Customization:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize your quilt set by adding your name or opting for additional pillowcases to make it uniquely yours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable in Multiple Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68''x86''), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), and King (102''x91'') to perfectly fit your bed.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift Idea:\u003c\/strong\u003e An excellent gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for family members and loved ones.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e This microfiber quilt set is machine washable; simply wash separately in cold water and air dry for lasting fluffiness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Each set includes 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from soft and durable polycotton fabric for comfortable use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u0